WEBVTT

00:19.820 --> 00:24.158
Tozasareta kioku no
naka no kizu ga

00:24.158 --> 00:28.829
Oto mo naku kokoro
ni fureru toki ni

00:28.829 --> 00:36.470
Yasashiku hohoemu sono ura
ni wa kodoku no namida

00:36.470 --> 00:41.342
Hateshinai tsuyosa motomete

00:41.342 --> 00:52.119
Shinjiru monotachi to
nando mo kakeagare

00:52.119 --> 00:54.188
Mamoritai

00:54.188 --> 00:56.490
Shinjitai

00:56.490 --> 01:00.728
Egao no wake wo subete

01:00.728 --> 01:05.132
Hageshisa mo itoshisa mo

01:05.132 --> 01:09.403
Zenbu uketomeru yo

01:09.403 --> 01:13.040
Nidoto sono te wo hanasanai

01:13.040 --> 01:21.744
Ano hikari wo mezashite...

01:30.758 --> 01:33.921
Previously on Shonen Onmyouji...

01:44.138 --> 01:47.369
[chant]

01:51.311 --> 01:53.279
Prepare yourself!

01:56.350 --> 01:58.352
Who are you?

01:58.352 --> 02:00.081
I am Kazane.

02:00.387 --> 02:03.948
Well, I think it's time
we called it a night.

02:06.560 --> 02:09.825
The Old Shadow Wanders
in the Night

02:15.803 --> 02:18.439
You don't seem happy
to see me, shikigami.

02:18.439 --> 02:21.742
You could have let me know
before you visit...

02:21.742 --> 02:23.243
Takaokami no Kami.

02:23.243 --> 02:26.013
I've come all the way...

02:26.013 --> 02:28.082
What a welcome you give me.

02:28.082 --> 02:30.107
I didn't summon you.

02:31.118 --> 02:33.987
There's a flurry of
activity in the capital.

02:33.987 --> 02:37.458
Vengeful spirits roaming about
and dead spirits overflowing.

02:37.458 --> 02:41.326
Such an end-of-the-year rush.

02:44.965 --> 02:48.867
Oh, so this is your
little secret.

02:49.603 --> 02:52.806
You are not... Masahiro.

02:52.806 --> 02:55.175
This is the dragon deity
of Kifune,

02:55.175 --> 02:57.511
Takaokami no Kami.

02:57.511 --> 02:59.346
She likes Masahiro,

02:59.346 --> 03:02.611
so she's been making
sudden visits lately...

03:03.650 --> 03:05.277
H-Hey!

03:06.553 --> 03:09.356
Your beauty is not bad
for a human.

03:09.356 --> 03:12.154
- You'll go a long way.
- Hey!

03:12.459 --> 03:15.462
This body won't be able to
take much more.

03:15.462 --> 03:17.555
I'll leave you for now.

03:18.198 --> 03:20.901
The future is going
to be so exciting...

03:20.901 --> 03:23.036
that I won't have time
to get bored!

03:23.036 --> 03:24.628
What?

03:27.307 --> 03:28.934
Masahiro!

03:29.309 --> 03:31.578
- Are you all right?
- Yes.

03:31.578 --> 03:33.637
I was just a little surprised.

03:41.188 --> 03:43.986
She said that something
is going to happen.

03:45.125 --> 03:49.830
I guess a deity's prediction
must be accurate.

03:49.830 --> 03:53.367
Furthermore, Seimei was attacked
by a mysterious woman.

03:53.367 --> 03:55.267
I don't like this.

03:59.206 --> 04:01.808
That's... a spirit.

04:01.808 --> 04:05.445
And he's wearing the uniform
of a border guard.

04:05.445 --> 04:06.680
Border guard?

04:06.680 --> 04:09.249
Yah, they are the soldiers
sent to Daizafu...

04:09.249 --> 04:11.785
to protect the Western
territories.

04:11.785 --> 04:16.023
Daizafu? Where Moronao
was exiled and died?

04:16.023 --> 04:18.116
It's not a coincidence.

04:20.794 --> 04:22.955
- Let's follow him.
- Right.

04:27.167 --> 04:28.869
Rikugou, what's the matter?

04:28.869 --> 04:31.895
Go ahead.
I'll be right with you.

04:42.683 --> 04:45.709
I've felt this spiritual
energy before.

04:47.020 --> 04:49.921
Could it possibly be... Kazane?

04:58.632 --> 05:02.728
You couldn't even defeat
an old man? That's pathetic!

05:03.203 --> 05:06.740
That voice... That aura...
Could it be...

05:06.740 --> 05:11.311
Why do you think I've trained you
and taught you all these spells?

05:11.311 --> 05:15.249
I did all that so that
you'd be able to kill Seimei.

05:15.249 --> 05:17.551
Please accept my apologies,
Master!

05:17.551 --> 05:19.853
Not only did you
let him escape,

05:19.853 --> 05:22.155
you've awoken an unneeded
spirit too...

05:22.155 --> 05:24.521
when you summoned
the vengeful ghost.

05:25.392 --> 05:28.996
So you were unaware?
You are worse than I'd thought.

05:28.996 --> 05:32.866
It was a mistake to think that
you could carry out this task.

05:32.866 --> 05:35.460
Please give me another
chance, Master!

05:42.843 --> 05:44.544
What did I do?

05:44.544 --> 05:49.345
Something awoke when I
revived the soul of Moronao...

05:54.321 --> 05:56.016
Kai...

05:58.825 --> 06:02.317
I can't afford to disappoint
Master any further.

06:04.264 --> 06:06.933
The crow's spiritual energy...

06:06.933 --> 06:10.027
That voice... Could it be?

06:14.574 --> 06:16.376
It's not a vengeful spirit.

06:16.376 --> 06:20.113
It doesn't have an evil aura, and
its spiritual energy is low.

06:20.113 --> 06:23.884
It seems like it's been dead
for over 200 years.

06:23.884 --> 06:26.648
But why is it walking
around only now?

06:27.387 --> 06:30.515
If it's not evil, I guess
I should set it free.

06:33.093 --> 06:35.425
Mokkun, what's that?

06:36.730 --> 06:40.600
It's a minor demon though
I've never seen one like that.

06:40.600 --> 06:43.770
Is it possible that several
spirits merged into one...

06:43.770 --> 06:45.761
and combined their auras
of evil?

06:52.245 --> 06:53.747
It's going to devour
that spirit!

06:53.747 --> 06:56.550
I won't be able to exorcise
the spirit then.

06:56.550 --> 06:58.652
Evil monster! Leave at once.

06:58.652 --> 07:00.449
Return to your place of origin.

07:04.257 --> 07:07.994
That evil aura of yours! You must
bring harm to the capital!

07:07.994 --> 07:12.132
It's your misfortune
to have met me.

07:12.132 --> 07:14.801
- Toshitsugu.
- What a fool!

07:14.801 --> 07:18.572
He should have escaped
when he had the chance.

07:18.572 --> 07:23.532
[chant]

07:24.010 --> 07:25.568
[chant]

07:32.819 --> 07:35.489
I don't understand!
It's not working!

07:35.489 --> 07:39.092
Don't go now! He'll probably demand
to know what you were doing here.

07:39.092 --> 07:40.160
But!

07:40.160 --> 07:42.229
If he discovers what's
been going on,

07:42.229 --> 07:44.891
Akiko's secret
will be exposed.

07:50.871 --> 07:53.039
- Toshitsugu!
- Masahiro!

07:53.039 --> 07:55.098
If I don't help him...

07:57.110 --> 07:59.613
- Touda.
- Rikugou!

07:59.613 --> 08:02.549
Rikugou, can I borrow that?

08:02.549 --> 08:05.848
- What's going on here?
- I'll tell you later!

08:10.757 --> 08:13.393
Now he looks like
a suspicious magician.

08:13.393 --> 08:15.293
Let's go, Rikugou.

08:16.496 --> 08:19.192
- Rikugou?
- Touda.

08:21.067 --> 08:22.193
Come on.

08:24.337 --> 08:25.605
Is this it?

08:25.605 --> 08:28.096
[chant]

08:34.514 --> 08:36.383
W-Who is that?

08:36.383 --> 08:41.421
[chant]

08:41.421 --> 08:44.390
[chant]

09:08.682 --> 09:11.947
What... exactly did he do?

09:20.894 --> 09:22.725
Are you all right?

09:24.764 --> 09:28.427
- What are you trying to say?
- Identify yourself!

09:28.568 --> 09:32.470
You were using strange spells.
What are you up to?

09:33.306 --> 09:36.476
- Evil! You are evil!
- No way!

09:36.476 --> 09:39.502
Return to your place of origin.

09:46.920 --> 09:50.447
- Masahiro!
- He's just passed out.

09:52.192 --> 09:54.820
Don't, Touda. Let's go.

10:08.041 --> 10:09.804
He's gone...

10:11.011 --> 10:14.071
He was... Could it be?!

10:21.988 --> 10:24.357
I'm sorry I couldn't
protect him.

10:24.357 --> 10:28.461
Fortunately, Toshitsugu's spell
is not very powerful.

10:28.461 --> 10:33.199
I'm sure a good night's rest
is all that Masahiro needs.

10:33.199 --> 10:35.599
What's wrong, Rikugou?

10:41.608 --> 10:43.974
Ryusai is alive.

10:44.578 --> 10:48.248
- You mean Enoki Ryusai?
- How do you figure?

10:48.248 --> 10:50.216
The crow that accompanies
Kazane...

10:50.216 --> 10:53.553
- It was speaking in his voice.
- Where were they?

10:53.553 --> 10:57.057
I followed them to a deserted
house after we parted.

10:57.057 --> 11:00.493
It was definitely
Ryusai's voice.

11:01.561 --> 11:03.290
He's still alive.

11:07.500 --> 11:08.935
Guren.

11:08.935 --> 11:12.872
That Ryusai's... still alive...

11:12.872 --> 11:15.508
Guren, Ryusai is dead.

11:15.508 --> 11:17.877
- But Rikugou...
- He's gone!

11:17.877 --> 11:20.914
We know that very well.

11:20.914 --> 11:24.873
But if he had managed to
find a way to come back...

11:26.987 --> 11:30.718
I'll send him back to
where he belongs!

11:46.139 --> 11:48.300
Look, my dear.

11:50.410 --> 11:52.779
They're like flowers,
aren't they?

11:52.779 --> 11:55.982
White flowers with six petals.

11:55.982 --> 11:59.611
That's why snowflakes
are called Six Petals.

12:01.955 --> 12:06.660
By the time you return,
our baby will be born.

12:06.660 --> 12:09.151
So take good care of yourself.

12:09.629 --> 12:11.965
In this village that
Six Petals fall on,

12:11.965 --> 12:15.457
I'll be waiting for you,
together with our child.

12:19.739 --> 12:23.677
You're awake?
How are you feeling?

12:23.677 --> 12:26.713
Hey, what's wrong,
Masahiro?

12:26.713 --> 12:31.951
I don't know...
But I'm really sad.

12:31.951 --> 12:35.055
Maybe because of
the dream... but...

12:35.055 --> 12:37.819
Masahiro, time to wake...

12:38.825 --> 12:40.894
A-Akiko.

12:40.894 --> 12:43.886
Masahiro, who is that?

12:44.664 --> 12:47.394
The man over there...

12:47.934 --> 12:50.232
Can't you see him, Masahiro?

12:56.876 --> 12:59.579
The spirit has gone deep
into your body.

12:59.579 --> 13:03.116
That's why only Miss Akiko
is able to see it.

13:03.116 --> 13:06.019
So the border guard from
yesterday possesses me?

13:06.019 --> 13:08.388
That's why you were
crying just now.

13:08.388 --> 13:10.957
You dreamt about his memory.

13:10.957 --> 13:12.822
What was the dream about?

13:13.693 --> 13:15.558
I don't remember.

13:16.696 --> 13:18.721
What is it, Grandfather?

13:19.733 --> 13:22.769
Alas, you are supposed
to be an onmyouji.

13:22.769 --> 13:27.640
How could you get possessed
so easily by a passing spirit?

13:27.640 --> 13:29.409
Please do not worry!

13:29.409 --> 13:32.537
I'll get rid of this spirit...
on my own.

13:32.846 --> 13:34.447
Masahiro!

13:34.447 --> 13:36.816
Suddenly my body feels
so weak.

13:36.816 --> 13:39.919
There are two spirits
dwelling in your body now.

13:39.919 --> 13:41.988
If you don't hurry up,

13:41.988 --> 13:44.891
the spirit will drain you
physically and spiritually,

13:44.891 --> 13:48.088
and you'll end up passing out!

13:48.628 --> 13:50.830
Will you stop scaring me?

13:50.830 --> 13:53.230
I'm just speaking the truth.

13:54.567 --> 13:56.102
I understand...

13:56.102 --> 13:58.671
But I am going to settle
this problem myself.

13:58.671 --> 14:01.307
I don't need your help,
Grandfather.

14:01.307 --> 14:03.935
- I'm leaving now.
- All right then.

14:13.253 --> 14:17.423
I wish I could at least find out
about his background.

14:17.423 --> 14:20.460
More than 10,000 guardsmen
were sent to Daizafu,

14:20.460 --> 14:22.362
and most of them were
commoners.

14:22.362 --> 14:25.092
I doubt there's any
records left.

14:26.332 --> 14:29.435
Yah, but I think...

14:29.435 --> 14:32.539
this person has always
been sad.

14:32.539 --> 14:35.275
I don't know what happened
in his life,

14:35.275 --> 14:38.178
but I sense this incredible
sadness in him.

14:38.178 --> 14:40.772
I want to do something
to help him.

14:41.981 --> 14:44.506
Who do you want to help?

14:46.419 --> 14:48.221
Toshitsugu!

14:48.221 --> 14:52.292
A-A sick sparrow got lost
and flew into my home.

14:52.292 --> 14:54.894
I was just thinking that
I'd like to help it.

14:54.894 --> 14:57.964
All you have to do is
cast a healing spell.

14:57.964 --> 15:00.733
I-I haven't really
mastered that.

15:00.733 --> 15:03.770
You can't even cast
basic spells like that?

15:03.770 --> 15:05.839
You are hopeless.

15:05.839 --> 15:07.807
Learn various spells...

15:07.807 --> 15:09.843
and help that poor creature.

15:09.843 --> 15:11.401
Yes.

15:12.345 --> 15:15.381
- By the way, Masahiro.
- Yes?

15:15.381 --> 15:18.509
What did you do last night?

15:19.252 --> 15:22.989
I was keeping the
sick sparrow warm.

15:22.989 --> 15:24.524
Is that so?

15:24.524 --> 15:28.324
I hope that the sparrow
gets well soon.

15:31.931 --> 15:35.435
Masahiro couldn't possibly
have used those spells.

15:35.435 --> 15:36.367
I was mistaken.

15:43.509 --> 15:47.013
I thought the ministerial
documents would be able to...

15:47.013 --> 15:49.649
provide some information
on what I seek.

15:49.649 --> 15:52.185
But I can't seem
to find anything.

15:52.185 --> 15:55.288
We don't know where
to begin.

15:55.288 --> 15:58.155
If only we knew his name
or hometown.

16:00.593 --> 16:02.262
Hey, are you all right?

16:02.262 --> 16:05.098
Yeah, I'm just feeling
a little tired.

16:05.098 --> 16:07.623
Let's call it quits for today.

16:09.302 --> 16:11.532
It's that aura from yesterday.

16:14.607 --> 16:18.678
This demonic mass is a result of
the disruption in the netherworld.

16:18.678 --> 16:20.546
Other than the guard's spirit,

16:20.546 --> 16:23.037
such a monster has been
summoned too?!

16:26.152 --> 16:28.354
Hidden warriors,
formidable soldiers!

16:28.354 --> 16:31.255
Assemble and take formation
against the enemy!

16:33.226 --> 16:36.129
That boy...
He's an onmyouji.

16:36.129 --> 16:40.225
[chant]

16:43.536 --> 16:45.605
That spiritual energy!

16:45.605 --> 16:48.768
Is he an onmyouji of
the Abe line?

16:49.409 --> 16:51.144
Are you all right, Masahiro?

16:51.144 --> 16:53.874
Yeah. I'm fine.

16:54.247 --> 16:55.682
Masahiro?!

16:55.682 --> 16:58.418
Abe no Masahiro?

16:58.418 --> 17:01.717
Lady, aren't you hurt?

17:02.255 --> 17:03.813
Why...

17:04.524 --> 17:06.617
Why are you still alive?

17:08.127 --> 17:12.065
It's impossible that
you are alive.

17:12.065 --> 17:14.100
Because I...

17:14.100 --> 17:15.761
I...

17:16.369 --> 17:18.735
I killed you 10 years ago!

17:20.440 --> 17:21.839
Could it be...

17:32.618 --> 17:35.121
So it was you 10 years ago!

17:35.121 --> 17:36.823
Who exactly are you?!

17:36.823 --> 17:41.089
So you didn't die back then.

17:41.694 --> 17:43.062
Answer me!

17:43.062 --> 17:47.522
Kazane. Does that sound familiar?
And now, Seimei's heir...

17:47.700 --> 17:49.565
Prepare to die!

17:50.236 --> 17:53.439
If you have a problem,
tell your grandfather later!

17:53.439 --> 17:57.876
[chant]

18:07.420 --> 18:09.655
I will finish you off this time.

18:09.655 --> 18:11.623
Seimei's heir!

18:14.894 --> 18:16.396
The guardsman...

18:16.396 --> 18:19.365
How timely. Now I don't
have to look for you...

18:19.365 --> 18:22.232
Both of you will disappear
once I kill the boy.

18:22.835 --> 18:24.666
Are you ready?

18:25.838 --> 18:28.739
Goodbye, Seimei's heir!

18:29.442 --> 18:31.410
Stop it!

18:43.423 --> 18:47.553
This power...
Could it be... you are...

18:48.428 --> 18:50.760
Touda, the shikigami!

18:51.197 --> 18:53.132
Very impressive.

18:53.132 --> 18:55.657
The bloodstained shikigami,
Touda!

18:58.104 --> 19:01.096
- Mokkun...
- Hey! What's going on?

19:01.941 --> 19:04.671
Hey! What are you
doing over there?!

19:07.914 --> 19:09.382
Masahiro!

19:09.382 --> 19:12.018
You're injured!
What happened?

19:12.018 --> 19:14.954
- I-I don't really know.
- You don't know?

19:14.954 --> 19:18.057
Don't lie to me! There's
such a strong aura here.

19:18.057 --> 19:21.160
It must have belonged
to a monster!

19:21.160 --> 19:25.431
You exorcised that great monster,
didn't you?

19:25.431 --> 19:27.200
- It's not like that.
- Then what was it?!

19:27.200 --> 19:30.536
I don't know.
I really have no idea.

19:30.536 --> 19:32.470
Masahiro!

19:41.013 --> 19:42.849
Kai...

19:42.849 --> 19:46.853
Seimei's grandson is... alive.

19:46.853 --> 19:50.990
Abe no Seimei...
and Touda, the shikigami...

19:50.990 --> 19:54.585
I definitely will not...
spare them!

20:01.000 --> 20:04.367
Minor demons...
They're really persistent!

20:11.244 --> 20:13.644
This can't be happening!

20:27.960 --> 20:29.621
Grandfather...

20:32.198 --> 20:34.634
I need to talk to Guren.

20:34.634 --> 20:36.869
Why don't you go back
to your room?

20:36.869 --> 20:38.427
Okay.

20:47.346 --> 20:48.973
Rikugou...

20:50.082 --> 20:51.913
About Guren...

20:53.586 --> 20:57.147
That your hand is
stained with sins.

20:57.890 --> 21:00.826
The bloodstained shikigami,
Touda!

21:00.826 --> 21:03.886
Did something happen
to Guren in the past?

21:05.831 --> 21:08.267
Ask Touda yourself.

21:08.267 --> 21:10.436
I'm not in the position
to speak,

21:10.436 --> 21:12.672
and I know Touda
wouldn't want me to.

21:12.672 --> 21:14.807
Yeah, you're right.

21:14.807 --> 21:17.910
What Touda tells you
is the truth.

21:17.910 --> 21:19.935
I can only tell you this much.

21:26.219 --> 21:27.914
Mokkun...

21:42.835 --> 21:54.347
Toki to shite hito wa dare mo
Yume wo miushinatte shimau

21:54.347 --> 22:05.625
Ayamachi ya kizutsukikata mo
Jidai wa kurikaesarete iku

22:05.625 --> 22:11.430
Doushite shinjiau koto ni aragauno?

22:11.430 --> 22:17.027
Doushite unmei to iu hikari kesuno?

22:19.305 --> 22:29.515
Bokutachi no mirai wa
Kono te de mamori nukitai

22:29.515 --> 22:36.489
Zenryoku de idomukoto no imi wo

22:36.489 --> 22:41.727
Kimi ga oshietekureta kara

22:41.727 --> 22:47.366
Motto motto kimi wa kimi o koete

22:47.366 --> 22:54.966
Kitto kitto kitto

22:59.845 --> 23:02.609
Next Episode

23:23.502 --> 23:25.104
Next on Shonen Onmyouji...

23:25.104 --> 23:26.672
Episode 17.

23:26.672 --> 23:26.939
Sleep in the Caress of
the Six Petals.

23:26.939 --> 23:29.169
Episode 17
Sleep in the Caress of
the Six Petals
Sleep in the Caress of
the Six Petals.
